   150	
   151	    Input structure:
   152	    - The grid has a black background, scattered colored source pixels, and one
   153	      global teal (8) connected component used as a shared template.
   154	    - Each rule example is a 4-neighbor source->target pair whose continued
   155	      direction lands on an anchor that touches or belongs to that same teal
   156	      component.
